      "text": "var a = effect(\"Fondu entrée (s)\")(\"Slider\"), b = effect(\"Fondu sortie (s)\")(\"Slider\"), k = 1;\nif (a > 0) k = Math.min(k, (time - inPoint) / a);\nif (b > 0) k = Math.min(k, (outPoint - time) / b);\nk = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, k));\nk * 100;"
